    questionText: "Apply optimal truncation to the complementary error function series at \\( x = 3 \\) to estimate \\( \\operatorname{erfc}(3) \\), and verify the error matches the least-term magnitude. (Reference value \\( \\operatorname{erfc}(3)=2.209050\\times10^{-5} \\).)",
