    questionText: "A divergent asymptotic series has term magnitudes \\( |t_n| = \\Gamma(n+a)\\,z^{-n} \\) for a fixed constant \\( a>0 \\) and large \\( z \\). Find the least-term index \\( n^\\ast \\) in terms of \\( z \\) and \\( a \\), and the leading behaviour of the least-term magnitude.",
